{"id":"n1-166","title":"Verbる にも","romaji":"Verb-ru ni mo","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Indicates that doing the verb is impossible or difficult, even if one wants to.","longExplanation":"Verbる にも is often used with an additional clause explaining why the action can’t be done. It can be translated as 'even if (I) want to do X, I can’t (because...)'.","formation":"Verb-dictionary form + にも + (reason it can't be done)","examples":[{"jp":"明日雨が降ったとしても、傘を持つにも荷物が多すぎる。","romaji":"Ashita ame ga futta to shite mo, kasa o motsu ni mo nimotsu ga oosugiru.","en":"Even if it rains tomorrow, I have too much luggage to bring an umbrella.","words":[{"surface":"明日","vocabId":"1584660","reading":"あした"},{"surface":"雨","vocabId":"1171900","reading":"あめ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"降っ","vocabId":"1282790","reading":"ふる","baseForm":"降る"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"として","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"傘","vocabId":"1301940","reading":"かさ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"持つ","vocabId":"1315720","reading":"もつ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"荷物","vocabId":"1195430","reading":"にもつ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"多","vocabId":"1407450","reading":"た","baseForm":"多い"},{"surface":"すぎる","vocabId":"1195970","reading":"すぎる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[13]},{"jp":"試験に落ちたが、もう一度受けるにもお金が足りない。","romaji":"Shiken ni ochita ga, mou ichido ukeru ni mo okane ga tarinai.","en":"I failed the exam, but I don’t have the money to take it again even if I wanted to.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"落ち","vocabId":"1548530","reading":"おち","baseForm":"落ちる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もう一度","vocabId":"2005860","reading":"もういちど"},{"surface":"受ける","vocabId":"1329590","reading":"うける"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"お金","vocabId":"1001820","reading":"おかね"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"足り","vocabId":"1404740","reading":"たりる","baseForm":"足りる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[8,9]},{"jp":"彼に会いたいと思っても、彼に会うにも難しい状況だ。","romaji":"Kare ni aitai to omotte mo, kare ni au ni mo muzukashii joukyou da.","en":"Even if I want to see him, it's a difficult situation to meet him.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会い","vocabId":"1198180","reading":"あう","baseForm":"会う"},{"surface":"たい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"思っ","vocabId":"1589350","reading":"おもう","baseForm":"思う"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会う","vocabId":"1198180","reading":"あう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"難しい","vocabId":"1460850","reading":"むずかしい"},{"surface":"状況","vocabId":"1356700","reading":"じょうきょう"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[12,13]},{"jp":"この空港から彼女の家に行くにもタクシーが必要だ。","romaji":"Kono kuukou kara kanojo no ie ni iku ni mo takushii ga hitsuyou da.","en":"I'd need a taxi to get from this airport to her house, even if I wanted to go.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"空港","vocabId":"1245570","reading":"くうこう"},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"家","vocabId":"1191730","reading":"いえ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行く","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"タクシー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"必要","vocabId":"1487660","reading":"ひつよう